    "summary": "[Eater Plague](vsdata:ability/death-guard.typhus.eater-plague) is available in your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase). Pick an enemy unit the PSYKER can see, up to 18″ away. For an unattached [Lone Operative](vsdata:core-ability/lone-operative), the limit is 12″. Roll a D6 to determine the [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds). A 1 means D3 against Typhus’s own unit. The enemy takes D6 for 2–5 or D3+3 for a 6.",
